#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:2
msgid "Colour sensors"
msgstr "彩色感測器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:4
msgid ""
"The photodiode in each cell is colour-blind. It counts photons of every "
"wavelength the silicon absorbs without distinguishing red from green from "
"blue. To get a colour image out of a colour-blind sensor, the manufacturer "
"covers the pixel grid with a *colour filter array* (CFA): a thin film of dye"
" that lets each cell see only one of the three primary colours."
msgstr ""
"每個感光單元中的光電二極體本身是色盲的。它會計數矽所吸收的每一種波長的光子，而不分辨紅、綠、藍。為了從一個色盲的感測器取得彩色影像，製造商在像素網格上覆蓋了一層\\"
" *彩色濾光陣列*\\ （CFA）：一層薄薄的染料膜，讓每個感光單元只能看見三原色中的其中一種。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:13
msgid "The Bayer pattern"
msgstr "拜耳（Bayer）圖案"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:15
msgid ""
"The dominant CFA layout is the *Bayer pattern*, named for its inventor at "
"Kodak. The film alternates two row types: even rows are a repeating red-"
"green pattern (red, green, red, green) and odd rows are a repeating green-"
"blue pattern (green, blue, green, blue). In the smallest repeating tile -- "
"two rows by two columns -- one cell sees red, one sees blue, and two see "
"green."
msgstr ""
"最主流的 CFA 佈局是\\ *拜耳圖案*\\ ，以其在 Kodak "
"的發明者命名。這層膜交替排列兩種列類型：偶數列是重複的紅綠圖案（紅、綠、紅、綠），奇數列是重複的綠藍圖案（綠、藍、綠、藍）。在最小的重複拼貼單元中——兩列乘以兩欄——有一個感光單元看見紅、一個看見藍、兩個看見綠。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:23
msgid ""
"A 6 column by 4 row grid of small squares\n"
"coloured according to the Bayer pattern. Even rows\n"
"alternate red and green; odd rows alternate green\n"
"and blue. Letters R, G, and B mark the colour of\n"
"each cell. The top-left two-by-two block is\n"
"outlined to indicate the smallest repeating tile,\n"
"which contains one red cell, one blue cell, and\n"
"two green cells."
msgstr ""
"一個 6 欄乘 4 列的小方格網格，\n"
"依照拜耳圖案著色。偶數列\n"
"交替紅與綠；奇數列交替綠\n"
"與藍。字母 R、G、B 標示出\n"
"每個感光單元的色彩。左上角的二乘二區塊以\n"
"外框標出，以指出最小的重複拼貼單元，\n"
"其中包含一個紅色感光單元、一個藍色感光單元，以及\n"
"兩個綠色感光單元。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:23
msgid ".. image:: ../figures/bayer-pattern.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: ../figures/bayer-pattern.svg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:33
msgid ""
"The Bayer colour filter array. Each cell of the sensor sees only one of the "
"three primary colours; green appears in two of every four cells."
msgstr "拜耳彩色濾光陣列。感測器的每個感光單元只看見三原色中的其中一種；綠色出現在每四個感光單元中的兩個。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:37
msgid ""
"Green is doubled on purpose. Human vision is much more sensitive to green "
"than to red or blue, and the perceived luminance of a scene is mostly "
"carried by the green channel. Sampling green at twice the density of red and"
" blue puts the resolution budget where the eye notices it most, and hides "
"the chrominance softness that follows."
msgstr ""
"綠色被刻意加倍。人類視覺對綠色的敏感度遠高於紅色或藍色，而一個場景所感知到的亮度大多由綠色通道承載。以紅色和藍色兩倍的密度對綠色取樣，把解析度的預算放在眼睛最容易察覺之處，並掩蓋了隨之而來的色度柔化。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:45
msgid "What each pixel records"
msgstr "每個像素記錄的內容"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:47
msgid ""
"A colour sensor still stores only one number per pixel -- the count of "
"photons that made it through that pixel's colour filter. A red-filter cell "
"records its red-channel value; the green and blue values at the same "
"location are simply missing from the data. The same is true for green and "
"blue cells."
msgstr ""
"彩色感測器每個像素仍只儲存一個數字——通過該像素彩色濾光片的光子計數。一個紅色濾光感光單元記錄它的紅色通道值；同一位置的綠色與藍色值則根本不存在於資料中。綠色與藍色感光單元亦同理。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:54
msgid ""
"The data that leaves the sensor in raw *Bayer* format is therefore one "
"channel per pixel, laid out in the Bayer pattern, rather than the three "
"channels per pixel of a finished colour image. Reconstructing the missing "
"two channels at every cell position is called *debayering*."
msgstr ""
"因此，以原始\\ *拜耳*\\ "
"格式離開感測器的資料是每個像素一個通道、依拜耳圖案佈局，而非成品彩色影像那樣每個像素三個通道。在每個感光單元位置重建那兩個缺失的通道，稱為\\ "
"*去拜耳*\\ （debayering）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:61
msgid "Microlenses and the chief ray angle"
msgstr "微透鏡與主光線角"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:63
msgid ""
"The colour filter is not the only thing on top of the photodiode. Above it "
"sits a tiny *microlens* that focuses the incoming light cone onto the "
"photodiode's active area, and the microlens is designed assuming the light "
"comes in close to perpendicular to the sensor surface. When light arrives at"
" a steep angle instead -- the :doc:`chief ray angle <../optics/real-lens-"
"effects>` that grows toward the corners of every real lens -- some of it can"
" land on the neighbouring pixel's filter instead, picking up the wrong "
"colour and producing *colour crosstalk*. Corner pixels lose saturation as "
"well, because part of the cone misses the photodiode entirely."
msgstr ""
"光電二極體上方並非只有彩色濾光片。在它之上還有一個微小的\\ *微透鏡*\\ "
"，將射入的光錐聚焦到光電二極體的感光區上，而這個微透鏡的設計假設光線是接近垂直於感測器表面射入的。當光線改以陡峭的角度抵達時——也就是在每一顆真實鏡頭中朝著角落逐漸增大的"
" :doc:`主光線角 <../optics/real-lens-effects>`\\ "
"——其中一部分光可能會落到相鄰像素的濾光片上，沾染到錯誤的色彩並產生\\ *色彩串擾*\\ "
"。角落的像素還會喪失飽和度，因為部分光錐完全錯過了光電二極體。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/vision/color/color-sensors.rst:76
msgid ""
"Sensors compensate by shifting each pixel's microlens radially outward from "
"the centre of the sensor, in concentric rings that expand from the middle "
"out to the corners. The shift is zero at the centre and grows to a few "
"microns at the outermost ring, tuned to a specific CRA profile baked into "
"the sensor's design. Pairing a sensor with a lens whose CRA profile differs "
"substantially from the design target leaves visible colour and sensitivity "
"errors in the corners, which is why image sensors and lenses are usually "
"chosen together."
msgstr ""
"感測器透過將每個像素的微透鏡自感測器中心沿徑向往外偏移來加以補償，以從中央向外擴展至角落的同心環方式進行。偏移量在中心為零，向外增長到最外環的數微米，並調校到一條烘焙進感測器設計中的特定"
" CRA 輪廓。若將某個感測器與一顆其 CRA "
"輪廓與該設計目標有顯著差異的鏡頭配對，便會在角落留下可見的色彩與靈敏度誤差，這也是為什麼影像感測器與鏡頭通常會一起挑選。"
